    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d182">

                <pb facs="0513" n="399" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg399"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to
                        Prime Minister Churchill
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d182-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-07-25">July 25, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Number 325 for the Former Naval Person from the
                    President personal and secret.</p>
                <p>I am perfectly delighted. I wish much that Lady
                        Warden and her daughter and the Colonel could come to Hyde Park on
                    arrival as my wife leaves on a month’s inspection trip on the 15th. If they
                    cannot come then I would hope for a visit later in August.</p>
                <pb facs="0514" n="400" xml:id="pg400"/>
                <p>The Staffs can begin their work at 
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Abraham</hi>
                     before the 17th and I will let you have a definite date shortly.</p>
                <p>I hope to go on a short trip to fish and sleep next Saturday.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d182-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d182-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the United States Naval Attaché London, via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
